<title>JAPAN: Kobe Steel plans 61 bln yen 1997/98 capex.</title>
<headline>Kobe Steel plans 61 bln yen 1997/98 capex.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kobe Steel Ltd said on Friday it plans parent company capital investment of 61 billion yen in the year to March 31, 1998, down 10 percent from 68 billion yen in 1996/97.  </p>
<p>Kobe said it plans depreciation costs of 77 billion yen in 1997/98, unchanged from the year before.</p>
